This activity will consist of simple home repairs and/or improvements such as: fixing wall and ceiling cracks, replacing doors, replacing bathroom equipment, interior and exterior wall painting, replacing kitchen equipment, roof sealing, among others. The Municipality estimate the repairs and/or improvements costs will be approximately $3,000 per household.

The Municipality will impact the following populations through this activity:
•	Individuals who suffered negative economic repercussions due to the COVID-19 pandemic;
•	households of low or moderate income; 
•	physic
